      {
        "action_date": "2025-10-10",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Bureau of Prisons Earnings Now Act of 2025 or the&nbsp;BOPEN Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill provides appropriations for the salaries and expenses of staff of the Bureau of Prisons (BOP) during any period in which interim or full-year appropriations for FY2026 or FY2027 are not in effect (i.e., a government shutdown). The bill does not apply to any officer of the BOP who is required to be appointed by the President with the advice and consent of the Senate.&nbsp;</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-10-20T13:36:59Z"
      }
    ]
